  "description": "A strongly-typed .NET 10 client for the Bancontact Pro Merchant APIs (Payment, Refund, Reconciliation) and its QR products (On a Display, On a Receipt, Static QR, Top Up, Invoice): per-product credentials, JWS-signed refund and reconciliation calls, JWKS-verified callbacks, QR payload URLs, and dependency injection registration.",
