  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Credentials now come from an IBancontactCredentialsProvider, read on every call: AddBancontactPro (generic or factory overload) for hosts that supply their own, with no startup validation, nothing captured and a JWKS client that follows the environment; AddBancontactProIntegration(IConfiguration) for static settings. IBancontactClientFactory is asynchronous. New BancontactEndpoints; PaymentLinkBuilder builds QR payload URLs for the configured environment. Payment, Refund and Reconciliation APIs (v3); per-product API key and PPID; callback verification against the Bancontact JWKS. Payment creation verified against the pre-production environment.",
